      "text": "What causes heightened sense of smell during pregnancy?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 20,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What can I do about a heightened sense of smell when I'm pregnant?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 32,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
